  "statuteText": "658:20 Clerk Pro Tem. –\n\nIf a town or ward clerk is absent from any state election or is unable to perform his duties and there is no deputy clerk as provided in RSA 41:18, a town or ward clerk pro tempore shall be appointed by the town clerk."
